(7263092, 1129506, 153814, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cobalt blue behind those clouds. Almost as nice as that downeast.;)</td>', 'Beautiful cobalt blue behind those clouds. Almost as nice as that downeast.;)', '2014-09-15 08:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263093, 1129876, 153814, '<td valign="top">Great shot it looks like the wake from a boat. Nice job.</td>', 'Great shot it looks like the wake from a boat. Nice job.', '2014-09-15 08:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263095, 1129618, 153814, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the sun rays. Well done.</td>', 'Nice job on the sun rays. Well done.', '2014-09-15 08:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263097, 1129772, 153814, '<td valign="top">Most people avoid power lines, you add them and it works.<br/>Amazing sky. Very well done.</td>', 'Most people avoid power lines, you add them and it works.Amazing sky. Very well done.', '2014-09-15 08:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263099, 1129881, 153814, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape but not too much as to distract from the unique sky.<br/>Well done it almost looks as if the sky is moving.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape but not too much as to distract from the unique sky.Well done it almost looks as if the sky is moving.', '2014-09-15 09:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263101, 1129780, 153814, '<td valign="top">Did someone say ORANGE? Very nice job on this. It''s like looking into a volcano.</td>', 'Did someone say ORANGE? Very nice job on this. It''s like looking into a volcano.', '2014-09-15 09:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263102, 1129744, 153814, '<td valign="top">Not the most amazing image in the challenge BUT it reminds me of the great time''s I had in Oklahoma. Thanks for the memories. Well done.</td>', 'Not the most amazing image in the challenge BUT it reminds me of the great time''s I had in Oklahoma. Thanks for the memories. Well done.', '2014-09-15 09:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263104, 1129775, 153814, '<td valign="top">WOW great colors, looks like a painting. Well done.</td>', 'WOW great colors, looks like a painting. Well done.', '2014-09-15 09:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263105, 1129433, 153814, '<td valign="top">Who doesn''t like to watch jet trails? Works for me.</td>', 'Who doesn''t like to watch jet trails? Works for me.', '2014-09-15 09:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263106, 1129544, 153814, '<td valign="top">Great title and great shot. Almost looks fake. Well done.</td>', 'Great title and great shot. Almost looks fake. Well done.', '2014-09-15 09:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263110, 1129847, 153814, '<td valign="top">Great contrast here. This works for me the sky is just really interesting. Nice job on this.</td>', 'Great contrast here. This works for me the sky is just really interesting. Nice job on this.', '2014-09-15 09:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263114, 1129880, 153814, '<td valign="top">Intersting take on the challenge. Nice transition from light to dark. well done.</td>', 'Intersting take on the challenge. Nice transition from light to dark. well done.', '2014-09-15 09:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263118, 1129573, 153814, '<td valign="top">I like it because it''s different.</td>', 'I like it because it''s different.', '2014-09-15 09:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263122, 1129698, 153814, '<td valign="top">Seems over saturated a bit. I do like how you capture what looks like two different skys in one image. Nice job.</td>', 'Seems over saturated a bit. I do like how you capture what looks like two different skys in one image. Nice job.', '2014-09-15 09:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263126, 1129501, 153814, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp image. I like the contrast between the land and sky. Nice job.</td>', 'Nice crisp image. I like the contrast between the land and sky. Nice job.', '2014-09-15 09:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263130, 1129857, 153814, '<td valign="top">Cool shot it almost looks as if it could be straight down as well.<br/>Like it was taken from the space station.<br/>Nice job on this.<br/> <br/>Back to fix a typo "TAKED" that''s just silly. sorry you had to read that.</td>', 'Cool shot it almost looks as if it could be straight down as well.Like it was taken from the space station.Nice job on this. Back to fix a typo "TAKED" that''s just silly. sorry you had to read that.', '2014-09-15 09:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263134, 1129501, 16148, '<td valign="top">Lovely openness.  Hope this does well for you.</td>', 'Lovely openness.  Hope this does well for you.', '2014-09-15 09:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263137, 1129757, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract!  Hope to see this in the top 10.</td>', 'Nice abstract!  Hope to see this in the top 10.', '2014-09-15 09:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263141, 1129741, 16148, '<td valign="top">Beautiful catch!  I''m glad you didn''t push sharpness and contrast to much.  Thanks</td>', 'Beautiful catch!  I''m glad you didn''t push sharpness and contrast to much.  Thanks', '2014-09-15 09:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263143, 1129717, 16148, '<td valign="top">These shots are always amazing.  Congratulations on a fine image!</td>', 'These shots are always amazing.  Congratulations on a fine image!', '2014-09-15 09:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263144, 1129698, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and well done.</td>', 'Nice idea and well done.', '2014-09-15 09:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263145, 1129869, 16148, '<td valign="top">Beautiful minimal landscape with dramatic sky.  Nice!</td>', 'Beautiful minimal landscape with dramatic sky.  Nice!', '2014-09-15 09:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263146, 1129824, 16148, '<td valign="top">Your warm toning works well here.  Thanks</td>', 'Your warm toning works well here.  Thanks', '2014-09-15 09:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263150, 1129577, 159723, '<td valign="top">I like the sky and the clouds. The ground could in my opinion need a bit more exposure.</td>', 'I like the sky and the clouds. The ground could in my opinion need a bit more exposure.', '2014-09-15 09:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263151, 1129841, 159723, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the power/phone lines takes too much of my attention, but wow what an amazing sky!</td>', 'Unfortunately the power/phone lines takes too much of my attention, but wow what an amazing sky!', '2014-09-15 09:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263155, 1129774, 159723, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites! What an amazing sky! I might be completely wrong here, but I think I would prefer it without the reflection in the water. I find the thin pink line a tiny bit distracting.</td>', 'One of my favorites! What an amazing sky! I might be completely wrong here, but I think I would prefer it without the reflection in the water. I find the thin pink line a tiny bit distracting.', '2014-09-15 10:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263156, 1129867, 63218, '<td valign="top">Ilike the way you processed this.</td>', 'Ilike the way you processed this.', '2014-09-15 10:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263157, 1129757, 159723, '<td valign="top">I first gave this a 6, but on second look I realised how unique this image is. So I''ve given you a new score :)</td>', 'I first gave this a 6, but on second look I realised how unique this image is. So I''ve given you a new score :)', '2014-09-15 10:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263161, 1129774, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice range of colors and patterns in this one, and I like the slight vignette whether that was naturally there or added. I imagine the feel and scent of the air was very nice when you shot this.</td>', 'Nice range of colors and patterns in this one, and I like the slight vignette whether that was naturally there or added. I imagine the feel and scent of the air was very nice when you shot this.', '2014-09-15 10:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263162, 1129854, 13077, '<td valign="top">That guy on the left must have gotten distracted and veered off course, maybe he saw a tempting target to poop on. lol<br/> <br/>I probably would have cropped like half an inch off the top of this, but it''s hard to say if the bit of clear sky at the very top adds anything or not.</td>', 'That guy on the left must have gotten distracted and veered off course, maybe he saw a tempting target to poop on. lol I probably would have cropped like half an inch off the top of this, but it''s hard to say if the bit of clear sky at the very top adds anything or not.', '2014-09-15 10:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263163, 1129758, 13077, '<td valign="top">Well done - very good detail in the sky and nicely framed with the trees. I wonder if the trees could have done with a little more sharpening, though.</td>', 'Well done - very good detail in the sky and nicely framed with the trees. I wonder if the trees could have done with a little more sharpening, though.', '2014-09-15 11:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263164, 1129789, 13077, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky - I like the three horizontal layers of the composition. Very well done.</td>', 'Beautiful sky - I like the three horizontal layers of the composition. Very well done.', '2014-09-15 11:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263166, 1129863, 13077, '<td valign="top">The sky is nice. I think some slight use of the burn tool to add some darkness and contrast in the clouds might have helped.</td>', 'The sky is nice. I think some slight use of the burn tool to add some darkness and contrast in the clouds might have helped.', '2014-09-15 11:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263167, 1129846, 13077, '<td valign="top">Handsome bird, and nicely framed in the clouds.</td>', 'Handsome bird, and nicely framed in the clouds.', '2014-09-15 11:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263168, 1129808, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Makes me miss my fisheye lens.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Makes me miss my fisheye lens.', '2014-09-15 11:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263169, 1129702, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the assortment of cloud types, and well done with the dynamic range and smooth tones.<br/> <br/>This would make a nice print, maybe on metallic paper and for a print I would probably edit out the clouds at the very bottom right and 1/4 up from the bottom left.</td>', 'I like the assortment of cloud types, and well done with the dynamic range and smooth tones. This would make a nice print, maybe on metallic paper and for a print I would probably edit out the clouds at the very bottom right and 1/4 up from the bottom left.', '2014-09-15 11:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263171, 1129674, 13077, '<td valign="top">Well exposed and pleasant tones.</td>', 'Well exposed and pleasant tones.', '2014-09-15 11:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263176, 1129775, 13077, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky. Great job capturing detail in the buildings at the bottom while keeping the highlights toned perfectly. I might have burned out the bright lights at the bottom right corner though. Still excellent overall.</td>', 'Beautiful sky. Great job capturing detail in the buildings at the bottom while keeping the highlights toned perfectly. I might have burned out the bright lights at the bottom right corner though. Still excellent overall.', '2014-09-15 11:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263179, 1129849, 13077, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this could have been improved by: <br/>1. Going closer to the wall if possible, to eliminate the bike<br/>2. Straightening the horizon<br/>3. Cloning out the blobs from a dirty sensor or lens in the sky.<br/>The tones &amp; colors look good though, reminds me of a Fuji print film.</td>', 'In my opinion, this could have been improved by: 1. Going closer to the wall if possible, to eliminate the bike2. Straightening the horizon3. Cloning out the blobs from a dirty sensor or lens in the sky.The tones & colors look good though, reminds me of a Fuji print film.', '2014-09-15 11:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263180, 1129832, 13077, '<td valign="top">Well positioned, I like how you captured the double yellow lines as they end and the dirt road begins. I wonder, though, if you had waited a little longer if some stars might have come out; that would bring some interest to the sky.</td>', 'Well positioned, I like how you captured the double yellow lines as they end and the dirt road begins. I wonder, though, if you had waited a little longer if some stars might have come out; that would bring some interest to the sky.', '2014-09-15 11:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263184, 1129475, 170281, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but what appears to be a street light to the left of the moon is distracting.</td>', 'I like the photo, but what appears to be a street light to the left of the moon is distracting.', '2014-09-15 11:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263187, 1129847, 13077, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene. This would probably make a good print, but I might crop out the branches at the bottom left corner.</td>', 'Pretty scene. This would probably make a good print, but I might crop out the branches at the bottom left corner.', '2014-09-15 11:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263188, 1129772, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic sky and well processed.</td>', 'Very dramatic sky and well processed.', '2014-09-15 11:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263189, 1129818, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice positioning of the solar panel. I like the angles and dramatic tones.</td>', 'Nice positioning of the solar panel. I like the angles and dramatic tones.', '2014-09-15 11:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263190, 1129803, 170281, '<td valign="top">The colors are amazing.  I would have loved to see a shot without the person and the view shifted slight to the left.  The outcropping is cool, but it would have been nice to see more of the sky exploited.</td>', 'The colors are amazing.  I would have loved to see a shot without the person and the view shifted slight to the left.  The outcropping is cool, but it would have been nice to see more of the sky exploited.', '2014-09-15 11:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263191, 1129717, 13077, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. This should get a ribbon.</td>', 'Beautiful. This should get a ribbon.', '2014-09-15 11:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263192, 1129718, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good job with the dynamic range and I like the texture in the water and the way the cloud reflections look.</td>', 'Good job with the dynamic range and I like the texture in the water and the way the cloud reflections look.', '2014-09-15 11:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263193, 1129791, 13077, '<td valign="top">Majestic for sure. Very well done.</td>', 'Majestic for sure. Very well done.', '2014-09-15 11:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263194, 1129789, 170281, '<td valign="top">I love how this appears to be a tidal wave in the sky.  It is a very intriguing photograph.  Nice work.</td>', 'I love how this appears to be a tidal wave in the sky.  It is a very intriguing photograph.  Nice work.', '2014-09-15 11:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263195, 1129867, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Great composition and dramatic sky. I like the graininess as well.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Great composition and dramatic sky. I like the graininess as well.', '2014-09-15 11:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263196, 1129820, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks like they forgot how to make a V. lol</td>', 'Looks like they forgot how to make a V. lol', '2014-09-15 11:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263197, 1129698, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, good colors and tones.</td>', 'Nicely done, good colors and tones.', '2014-09-15 11:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263198, 1129843, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I like the angle of the gradient in the sky versus the architectural angles, and the blimp in the sky centers it all very well.</td>', 'Interesting. I like the angle of the gradient in the sky versus the architectural angles, and the blimp in the sky centers it all very well.', '2014-09-15 11:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263199, 1129876, 13077, '<td valign="top">Great composition and beautiful tones.</td>', 'Great composition and beautiful tones.', '2014-09-15 11:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263200, 1129577, 13077, '<td valign="top">The clouds look good, but I''m not crazy about the slight green cast to the shadows in the foregroud. I do like the composition though.</td>', 'The clouds look good, but I''m not crazy about the slight green cast to the shadows in the foregroud. I do like the composition though.', '2014-09-15 11:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263201, 1129624, 13077, '<td valign="top">Well composed and exposed. The dynamic range in the clouds is just right.</td>', 'Well composed and exposed. The dynamic range in the clouds is just right.', '2014-09-15 11:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263202, 1129880, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely done but there seems to be a tiny bit of camera shake - also the beginning of star trails are good but if you have a way to get the exposure longer like a cable release or something that would have looked even better.</td>', 'Nicely done but there seems to be a tiny bit of camera shake - also the beginning of star trails are good but if you have a way to get the exposure longer like a cable release or something that would have looked even better.', '2014-09-15 11:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263203, 1129573, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition and I like the old fashioned feel of it.</td>', 'Very cool composition and I like the old fashioned feel of it.', '2014-09-15 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263204, 1129433, 13077, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the tones and lack of contrast on this one.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the tones and lack of contrast on this one.', '2014-09-15 11:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263206, 1129741, 170281, '<td valign="top">I like the scene.  I wish there was greater DoF so the crane/egrit (?) were in better focus and the sky looked less washed-out.  Again, I think yu picked a great scene to shoot.</td>', 'I like the scene.  I wish there was greater DoF so the crane/egrit (?) were in better focus and the sky looked less washed-out.  Again, I think yu picked a great scene to shoot.', '2014-09-15 11:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263207, 1129761, 13077, '<td valign="top">Some more dramatic clouds would have helped this one for sure. I like the splash of color though.</td>', 'Some more dramatic clouds would have helped this one for sure. I like the splash of color though.', '2014-09-15 11:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263209, 1129881, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent job with the exposure and processing. The sky compliments the scene very well.</td>', 'Excellent job with the exposure and processing. The sky compliments the scene very well.', '2014-09-15 11:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263210, 1129855, 13077, '<td valign="top">Maybe red would have worked better than light yellow for this concept?</td>', 'Maybe red would have worked better than light yellow for this concept?', '2014-09-15 11:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263211, 1129818, 170281, '<td valign="top">It is amazing what some perspective and framing will do to a photograph.  I appreciate how you kept the scene simple yet provide a dramatic effect.  Nice photo.</td>', 'It is amazing what some perspective and framing will do to a photograph.  I appreciate how you kept the scene simple yet provide a dramatic effect.  Nice photo.', '2014-09-15 11:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263212, 1129857, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and the patterns.</td>', 'I like the tones and the patterns.', '2014-09-15 11:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263213, 1129878, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cool - I like the angles and the light, well done.</td>', 'Very cool - I like the angles and the light, well done.', '2014-09-15 11:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263215, 1129872, 170281, '<td valign="top">Great title...I saw that immediately.  The B&amp;W adds the additional dramatic effect.  Great shot!</td>', 'Great title...I saw that immediately.  The B&W adds the additional dramatic effect.  Great shot!', '2014-09-15 11:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263216, 1129781, 13077, '<td valign="top">I think playing with the curves adjustment for the sky would have helped - this is fairly monotonous as-is.</td>', 'I think playing with the curves adjustment for the sky would have helped - this is fairly monotonous as-is.', '2014-09-15 11:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263219, 1129757, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Great textures and shapes.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Great textures and shapes.', '2014-09-15 11:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263220, 1129780, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic contrast and colors, but it looks a little unsharp to me. The horizon also doesn''t look level, but I can''t tell if it''s because the mountains are taller on the right.</td>', 'Very dramatic contrast and colors, but it looks a little unsharp to me. The horizon also doesn''t look level, but I can''t tell if it''s because the mountains are taller on the right.', '2014-09-15 11:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
