(7264485, 1129772, 177322, '<td valign="top">The title says it all:  powerful!  Explosive energy. Subject wise, I like the connection between the sun''s natural intensity and man''s control of electricity.  Effective composition.  Good luck.</td>', 'The title says it all:  powerful!  Explosive energy. Subject wise, I like the connection between the sun''s natural intensity and man''s control of electricity.  Effective composition.  Good luck.', '2014-09-19 15:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264507, 1129544, 177322, '<td valign="top">What a romantic title!  And, what a lovely shot: the lighthouse peeking above the rock; that glowing golden autumnal moon; those perfect, perfect cirrus clouds, black sea...simply dreamy.  Compositionally well balanced, colors are good, sharp focus.  Sterling submission for this challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'What a romantic title!  And, what a lovely shot: the lighthouse peeking above the rock; that glowing golden autumnal moon; those perfect, perfect cirrus clouds, black sea...simply dreamy.  Compositionally well balanced, colors are good, sharp focus.  Sterling submission for this challenge.  Good luck.', '2014-09-19 18:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264508, 1129846, 177322, '<td valign="top">Mesmerizing. Maybe I would have liked a sharper focus on the hawk and a little less centered, but this image still is a very laudable entry for this challenge. Good luck.</td>', 'Mesmerizing. Maybe I would have liked a sharper focus on the hawk and a little less centered, but this image still is a very laudable entry for this challenge. Good luck.', '2014-09-19 18:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
