(7264516, 1129665, 177322, '<td valign="top">Impressive! My eye moves equally between the components of the composition: the sea, the buildings, and of course that dramatic sky.  Very strong image for this competition.  Good luck.</td>', 'Impressive! My eye moves equally between the components of the composition: the sea, the buildings, and of course that dramatic sky.  Very strong image for this competition.  Good luck.', '2014-09-19 18:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
