(7264910, 1129775, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like it, but why no title?  I think you would have been within the rule set to eliminate those few lights in the lower right corner (they''re distracting from the entire presentation).</td>', 'I like it, but why no title?  I think you would have been within the rule set to eliminate those few lights in the lower right corner (they''re distracting from the entire presentation).', '2014-09-21 21:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
